# NAME: HK-Restricted
# AUTHOR: lwtdzh
# DESC: Domains / IPs of services that are geo-blocked or region-unsupported on
#       Hong Kong (and often mainland China) exit IPs. Route these through a
#       non-HK node (e.g. US) via the "🚫 HK-Restricted" proxy group.
# NOTE: OpenAI / ChatGPT / Claude / Copilot / GitHub Copilot domains are NOT
#       duplicated here — they are already fed into the HK-Restricted group by
#       the OpenAi rulesets referenced in LWT_Custom_Rule.ini. This file adds
#       the *other* HK-restricted services.

# ============ Google Gemini / AI Studio / Bard ============
DOMAIN,gemini.google.com
DOMAIN,bard.google.com
DOMAIN,aistudio.google.com
DOMAIN,makersuite.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ai.google.dev
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,generativelanguage.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,alkalimakersuite-pa.clients6.google.com
DOMAIN,proactivebackend-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,labs.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,labs.google
DOMAIN,deepmind.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,deepmind.com
DOMAIN,notebooklm.google
DOMAIN,notebooklm.google.com

